[[File:Juggernaut-transport.png|thumb|right|225px|The Imperial Combat Assault Transport, a type of ground assault vehicle]]
'''Ground assault vehicle''' ('''GAV''') was a catchall term encompassing a multitude of [[armored cavalry]] ground vehicles, from [[troop transport]]s to heavily armed combat assault [[tank]]s<ref name="Visual Guide">''[[Star Wars: Rogue One: The Ultimate Visual Guide]]''</ref> such as the [[HCVw A9.2 juggernaut transport]].<ref name="Juggernaut driver DB">{{Databank|imperial-juggernaut-driver|Imperial Juggernaut Driver}}</ref> [[Imperial combat driver]]s operated the many GAVs of the [[Galactic Empire]]'s [[Imperial Army|army]].<ref name="Visual Guide">''[[Star Wars: Rogue One: The Ultimate Visual Guide]]''</ref>

